    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19015,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "General plastic equilibrium and PNA branches",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 2,
        "annex": {
          "kind": "heading",
          "id": "pna"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19051,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 21,
        "html": "General force model — y measured down from the steel top",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#334155",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19078,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "w_a(y) is the rolled width including root fillets; A_a and W_pl alone do not locate the PNA.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19103,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Compressed steel area above the PNA:  A_ac(y) = ∫₀^y w_a(z) dz",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19128,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Axial equilibrium:  2 f_yd A_ac(y_a) + N_c = A_a f_yd",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19153,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "First moment about the slab top:  Q_ac(y) = ∫₀^y (h_c + z) w_a(z) dz",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_ms",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19178,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Moments about the slab top:  M = f_yd A_a (h_c + h_a/2) − 2 f_yd Q_ac(y_a) − N_c x_c/2",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19203,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Reducing η lowers Nc and xc and increases Aac, so the steel PNA moves down; the two axes differ.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19234,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 21,
        "html": "Branch boundaries for a symmetric rolled I-section in sagging",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#334155",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19261,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Slab PNA, steel all in tension: full connection with N_a,Rd &lt;= N_c,Rd (Aac = 0).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19286,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Top flange: 0 &lt; Aac &lt;= ba tf, i.e. η &gt;= η_f = 1 - 2 ba tf/Aa; ya = Aac/ba.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19311,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Fillet transition: ba tf &lt; Aac &lt; A_fr. Width varies with the arc; not implemented here.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_my",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19336,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Web below the fillet toe: Aac &gt;= A_fr; ya = tf + r + (Aac - A_fr)/tw (fillets included).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_mz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19361,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Never mix the sharp-corner web formula ya = tf + (Aac - ba tf)/tw with a filleted area Aa.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_n0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19386,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Lower flange: inadmissible, because Nc &gt;= 0 and zero axial force give Aac &lt;= Aa/2.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_n1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 19455,
      "props": {
        "w": 304,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Connection degree with the PNA at the fillet toe",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_n1"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_n2",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 396,
      "y": 19411,
      "props": {
        "w": 222,
        "h": 105,
